1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:02,000
Reading

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,420
Theme parks

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:07,900
Fun and more than fun

4
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:12,120
Which theme park would you like to visit?

5
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,200
There are various kinds of theme parks,

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,300
with a different park for almost everything:

7
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:22,540
food, culture, science, cartoons,

8
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,880
movies or history.

9
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:30,720
Some parks are famous for having the biggest or longest roller coasters,

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,080
others for showing the famous sights and sounds of a culture.

11
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,860
Whichever and whatever you like,

12
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,000
there is a theme park for you!

13
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:45,760
The theme park you are probably most familiar with is Disneyland.

14
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,580
It can be found in several parts of the world.

15
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,700
As you wander around the fantasy amusement park,

16
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:10,900
you may see Snow White or Mickey Mouse in a parade or on the street.

17
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,860
Of course Disneyland also has many exciting rides,

18
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:18,780
from giant swinging ships to terrifying free-fall drops.

19
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:20,900
With all these attractions,

20
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:24,180
no wonder tourism is increasing wherever there is a Disneyland.

21
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:28,080
If you want to have fun and more than fun,

22
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,460
come to Disneyland!

23
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:38,020
Dollywood, in the beautiful Smoky Mountains in the southeastern USA,

24
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:41,360
is one of the most unique theme parks in the world.

25
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:46,620
Dollywood shows and celebrates America's traditional southeastern culture.

26
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:52,400
Although Dollywood has rides, the park's main attraction is its culture.

27
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:05,180
People come from all over America to see carpenters and other craftsmen make wood,

28
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:08,780
glass and iron objects in the old-fashioned way.

29
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:17,040
Visit the candy shop to try the same kind of candy that American southerners made 150 years ago,

30
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:22,440
or take a ride on the only steam- engine train still working in the southeast USA.

31
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:28,520
You can even see beautiful bald eagles in the world's largest bald eagle preserve.

32
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:31,120
And for those who like rides,

33
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:34,780
Dollywood has one of the best old wooden roller coasters,

34
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:35,780
Thunderhead.

35
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:46,400
Come to Dollywood to have fun learning all about America's historical southeastern culture!

36
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:55,740
If you want to experience the ancient days and great deeds of English knights

37
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:58,320
and ladies, princes and queens,

38
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:01,920
then England's Camelot Park is the place for you.

39
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:07,140
Every area of the park is modelled after life in the days of King Arthur

40
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:09,320
and the Knights of the Round Table.

41
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:14,180
In one place, you can watch magic shows with Merlin the Wizard.

42
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:18,500
If you want to see fighting with swords or on horseback,

43
00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:21,800
then the jousting area is a good place to visit.

44
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:28,820
If you do well there, King Arthur may choose you to fight in the big jousting tournament.

45
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,940
Do you like animals?

46
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,560
Then visit the farm area,

47
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:38,700
and learn how people in ancient England ran their farms

48
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:40,640
and took care of their animals.

49
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:45,240
To enter a world of fantasy about ancient England,

50
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,600
come to Camelot Park!
